    "premises": "The pure lifecycle receives bounded supplied public facts and protected-capability validity facts, never the private notification address, and returns action requests without executing them. The checked bootstrap retains no private endpoint path; the pending build-owned register cannot yield a served context. A private formatting helper redacts source values before observation.",
